          'Make every square inch count with smart layouts that keep your interiors open, airy, and functional.',
      },
      {
        title: 'Aesthetic Designs & Theme Styling',
        description:
          'Curate colour palettes, fabrics, furniture and decor elements around your preferred interior style.',
      },
      {
        title: 'Space Enhancement & Surface Upgrades',
        description:
          'Enhance walls, lighting, wallpapers and furnishings to bring sophistication to every corner.',
      },
